[3.796776, "o", "        # Public FDA Label Data\r\n\r\n        This directory contains only public task inputs for `fda-hard-mixed-batch`.\r\n\r\n        - `labels.jsonl` has full FDA label rows with `label_raw` and `chunks`.\r\n        - `questions.jsonl` has 10 public questions.\r\n        - Gold answers, references, citations, and curated context are not included here.\r\n\r\n        Labels included:\r\n        - Paxlovid (`8a99d6d6-fd9e-45bb-b1bf-48c7f761232a`)\r\n- Lopinavir-Ritonavir (`4b1caefa-e6a2-42f3-9194-6dc1dd9e6d85`)\r\n- 12HR Allergy Relief (`ea5d0e55-2191-4094-b082-24b317f95752`)\r\n- Acamprosate Calcium (`ae6e79c0-a307-4888-b647-1b7be4cb9127`)\r\n"]
