[107.438362, "o", "PASSAGE_0098: Human Data\r\nLopinavir and ritonavir was evaluated in 12 HIV-infected pregnant women in an open-label pharmacokinetic trial . No new trends in the safety profile were identified in pregnant women dosed \r\n"]
